  "implemented": [
    "Seven field/mileage/interruption/cancellation/support-trip kinds carry strict ID/version/fixed-action references only; locations, actual mileage, hashes, credentials and draft content cannot enter pending storage",
    "Existing per-tab scheduling store, original-review controller and authenticated scheduling original transport are reused; exact binding, no overwrite, abort/replacement fences and acknowledged removal stay enforced",
    "Typed lookup invokes the complete independent domain source/audit receipt verifier before emitting a minimized recovery receipt; no original_recorded observation or absent lookup can clear pending state",
    "Explicit fresh-auth retirement reuses the unchanged unique operation claim and audited retirement implementation; later original execution cannot pass the retired key",
    "All seven kinds race original-first and retirement-first through actual observed PostgreSQL transaction-ID waits, with exactly one durable operation",
    "The existing booked-job full original receipt remains unchanged; SQL and application validators agree for all37 current kinds while registered older schemas retain their closed kind snapshots",
    "A different support command kind at the same UUID returns operation conflict; typed result identities/versions and full source bindings are checked",
    "Source-audit recovery lists up to10000 identifiers now fit the existing1MiB response budget; the original transport uses the same finite20000-node budget as its other reads. Strict domain count10000, depth32, duplicate-key rejection, no-store/CSRF/auth and byte limits remain"
  ],
  "retainedFailures": [
